message.content:
Complete the assignment below, thoroughly:

# Target
Cache routing + provider + session persistence layer of PR #2407 (branch feat/gh-2394-compaction-handover). Files (diff vs origin/main): NEW lib/src/agent/stream_cache_routing.dart; modified lib/src/compaction/cache_policy.dart, lib/src/model_roles/provider_catalog.dart, model_resolver.dart, lib/src/providers/anthropic.dart, copilot.dart, lib/src/session/session_record.dart, session_tree.dart, agent_session_manager.dart, lib/src/prompts/prompt_overrides.dart, prompts.g.dart, scripts/gen_prompts.dart, lib/flutter_agent_harness.dart (barrel).

# Change
Hunt lens: contract safety + backward compatibility.
(1) stream_cache_routing.dart + cache_policy.dart sessionAffine — NULL fallthrough semantics (sessionId/cacheRetention null → host defaults), StreamCallShape fields (toolChoice/maxTokens/prefixLength/copilotInitiator) plumbed into provider Options; affine/isolated paths must stay byte-identical (ticket AC10). (2) anthropic.dart — history breakpoint at prefixLength (last user turn), 4-breakpoint budget behavior, no history breakpoint when S0 ends assistant, tool_choice none; copilot.dart — maxTokens plumbing (x-initiator pin is a KNOWN listed gap — do not raise as new). (3) provider_catalog.dart — does the routing change affect the MAIN request path (must be zero-diff for existing calls: REG byte-identity)? Any regression for providers NOT in the table (google, dial, openai_completions, chatgpt-codex)? (4) session_record.dart — additive fields labels/consolidated/layout: old-format files still parse (parser reads only named keys?), new fields serialize compactly, no new record kinds (ticket invariant I7: append-only, no migration). (5) session_tree.dart — appendHiddenRange(consolidated, labels) and appendCompactCheckpoint(layout) signatures; render path of new marker forms; hidden_index section; is anything rewritten (append-only violation)? (6) Barrel lib/flutter_agent_harness.dart — new exports follow the APPEND-ONLY grouped-section rule (AGENTS.md), sorted; prompts.g.dart regeneration consistent with prompts/compaction/hand_over.md (prompts_sync_test gate); scripts/gen_prompts.dart format-stability fix is sound.

# Acceptance
Verified candidate findings with exact file:line evidence; empty list if clean.

Your FINAL message MUST be exactly one JSON document satisfying this JSON Schema — no prose, no markdown fences, nothing else:

{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "findings": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "path": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "line": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "severity": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "BLOCKING",
              "IMPORTANT",
              "SUGGESTION",
              "NIT"
            ]
          },
          "claim": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "path",
          "line",
          "severity",
          "claim"
        ]
      }
    },
    "notes": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "findings"
  ]
}

